            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Virtual RUN-Immersive Real-World Training Scenarios",
            "content": "<p>Reject boredom when running. Immerse yourself in interactive training scenarios.  Step into a world of realistic, 3D environments that make every run an adventure. Whether you're sprinting through city streets or jogging along scenic trails, the <strong>3D Immersive Experience</strong> transports you to captivating landscapes, enhancing your motivation and making your workouts more enjoyable and engaging.</p>",
